                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;">Biomedicine is a critical pillar for advancing the <em>Healthy China Initiative (2019–2030)</em> and promoting the transition from “Made in China” to “Created in China.” Drug design and drug discovery constitute the core frontier disciplines of innovative drug development. As an advanced graduate-level course building upon the nationally recognized first-class undergraduate course <em>Drug Design</em>, this course is taught by faculty with extensive practical experience and provides a systematic introduction to the fundamental principles, methodologies, and recent advances in drug design, with an emphasis on developing scientific thinking and molecular design capabilities.</span></p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
